<human_speech><green>Lineage five is not like the others. We added a term to the score: be different from what already exists.<\green><blue>And it is different. It garrisons. It defends. It attacks from one place at a time, and only when it is sure.<\blue><green>It also beats the other five. Every one of them.<\green><blue>The raid that worked on its ancestors will not work here, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. Think about what it cannot see.<\blue><\human_speech>
